name: Touch Cursor
icon: https://mahi902.github.io/DocuWritePro/sca/touch-cursor/icon.svg
version: 1.0.1
creator: Mohtadi Azad Mahi
description: Adds a desktop-style virtual cursor to touch-screen devices, controlled with a movable cursor pad. Supports hover, left/right click, hold, drag, text caret placement, custom cursors, cursor-pad gestures, and extensive pointer customization.
